To 3):
Rodney still has the Book of the Dead, your quest nemesis had the Bell
of Opening. So far, so good.
The "third bit" you asked about is the Candelabrum of Invocation,
currently owned by Vlad the Impaler. You can find him in his very own
tower (3 levels high), just look for a second upstair somewhere in
Gehennom.
The "demon on the swamp level" (Juiblex) didn't have anything you
really need, and neither do his demon prince buddies. Orcus carries a
wand of death, which could be considered as important for the ascension
run, but it's not a "must have".

It was actually a somewhat bad idea to tackle Rodney this early.
Ideally, you should have explored all of Gehennom, found the vibrating
square, and have the Bell and Candelabrum in your possession before
facing the wizard, to keep the time during which he can pester you as
short as possible.

